WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
narrator: Linux instruction tour; installation is not performed here.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
narrator: Package installation lines are shell comments.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
narrator: Only the installed client's version is queried.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
narrator: Login server and preauthorization examples remain comments.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
narrator: The next live command inspects the runner's existing status.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
narrator: Peer ping is an instruction, not an executed check.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.500
narrator: The displayed pong is a comment, not reachability evidence.
